1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,326
Waking up at 3am with a sour, burning taste in your throat?

2
00:00:03,646 --> 00:00:07,059
Nearly a third of Americans get heartburn weekly, most of it at night.

3
00:00:07,379 --> 00:00:13,070
Lying flat removes the gravity that keeps acid down, and coffee, spicy food, and tomato sauce make it worse.

4
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:18,083
Coffee relaxes the muscle holding acid down - have it with food, and cut it off a few hours before bed.

5
00:00:18,403 --> 00:00:21,248
Spicy food irritates the esophagus and slows digestion.

6
00:00:21,568 --> 00:00:25,202
Cut hot sauce to a small drizzle, or season with basil and oregano instead.

7
00:00:25,522 --> 00:00:30,252
Tomato sauce is naturally acidic - a pinch of baking soda stirred in neutralizes a good chunk of it.

8
00:00:30,572 --> 00:00:36,263
None of these need to disappear completely - just watch the timing, and prop your head up if reflux wakes you at night.
